              #### <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="copy-ip-link" data-copy="mc8-play4.yuaner.tw" data-tooltip="點選複製"><code>mc8-play4.yuaner.tw</code></a> <span class="badge badge-success">TCP</span> <span class="badge badge-secondary">IPv4</span> <span class="badge badge-info">Sable(UDP)</span> - Yuan MC8 伺服器 TCP IPv4 Only 直連
